b.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3036749279/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3036752665","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108273#issuecomment-3036752665","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108273","id":3036752665,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61ASsZ","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-04T15:51:18Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T16:09:27Z","body":"I think it's worth noting that reflection probes exhibit the same issue, though less egregiously.\n\nMRP in 4.5 beta2 with a refprobe:\n\n| | Refprobe | Sky | Blender Cycles |\n| - | - | - | - |\n| Front | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/20263c95-2f68-4529-9b8a-24465968884e) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7f55fc51-a18b-484e-9c87-dfcb5f4f983d) | <img width=\"422\" height=\"422\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8ec1f604-b310-41c0-bd90-fc5c84194b6b\" /> |\n| Top | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba8be8b8-7d18-4b46-ad62-0570b4512ff2) |![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31c2c118-58a7-464d-abb2-6ecee80516ea) | <img width=\"422\" height=\"422\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ffd64d44-8a85-4599-8f07-52e6d89a90d9\" /> |\n| Bottom | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8c5e790b-6b00-48c8-be67-3127cddf450e) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23d26097-655c-498a-a8ce-304932735d4c) | <img width=\"422\" height=\"422\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cbb36b43-c5b7-4e34-a71c-767d578800a7\" /> |","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3036752665/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3036883243","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108273#issuecomment-3036883243","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108273","id":3036883243,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61Aykr","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-04T16:58:07Z","updated_at":"2025-07-04T16:58:35Z","body":"@clayjohn said 'real time' takes another path to calculate the irradiance, without ggx. I can confirm with `process_mode` set to Real Time, ggx sample count does not affect the result. Neither does \"Fast filter high quality\", as far as I can see (though according to the description, it should). The green bleed is one of the worst ones yet in this mode, with 0.62 green (and 0.95 blue).\n\n<img width=\"444\" height=\"352\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/030ba872-b6e3-405c-b882-5fc388ccfd73\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3036883243/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3040307507","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108273#issuecomment-3040307507","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108273","id":3040307507,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61N2kz","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-05T21:47:24Z","updated_at":"2025-07-05T21:47:24Z","body":"Note about #108127 and its relationship with this bug:\n\nAs it stands right now, #108127 will replace cubemap arrays with SH for ambient lighting, which would \"solve\" this problem.\n\nHowever the cubemap arrays will still be used for rough specular reflections, thus the bleeding problem should still be possible to reproduce by doing the following:\n\n1. Set roughness to maximum (to use the last mip, like ambient does)\n2. Set metalness to maximum (because specular lighting is where cubemap array reflections are)\n3. (maybe some other material setting I'm forgetting, likely fresnel is relevant)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3040307507/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3041321263","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108273#issuecomment-3041321263","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108273","id":3041321263,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61RuEv","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-06T11:03:32Z","updated_at":"2025-07-06T11:04:32Z","body":"> However the cubemap arrays will still be used for rough specular reflections, thus the bleeding problem should still be possible to reproduce by doing the following:\n> 1. Set roughness to maximum (to use the last mip, like ambient does)\n> 2. Set metalness to maximum (because specular lighting is where cubemap array reflections are)\n\nI don't think that's something to really worry about since that is an atypical material anyways in PBR. It's something you don't really come across in game art. Even for stylized art, the only reason I can think of why a user might want a full rough/metal material is because they like the way the engine makes it look, there's no preconceived expected look for full rough metals since they don't exist in the real world.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3041321263/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3712280399","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108273#issuecomment-3712280399","issue_url":"http